We=E2=80=99ve updated settings that manage personalization and activity his=
tory on Play. You=E2=80=99ll have dedicated controls for personalization on=
 Play and for saving activity in your Google Account=E2=80=99s Play History=
, and these settings will be easily accessible in the Google Play menu.
</td>
