p: 15px;">
After the transition is complete, WAA and Play settings will be separate, a=
nd changes to one will no longer affect the other. You can view and change =
your Play privacy settings in <a target=3D_blank style=3D"color: #1a73e8;" =
href=3Dhttps://myactivity.google.com/product/google_play/personalization>Pe=
rsonalization in Play</a> at any time. <a target=3D_blank style=3D"color: #=
1a73e8;" href=3Dhttp://support.google.com/googleplay?p=3Dpersonalize_play_m=
igration>Learn more about the transition and how it affects your settings</=
a>
</td>
</tr>
